| Graph Type               | Edge Weight         | Cycles? | Algorithm                         |
| ------------------------ | ------------------- | ------- | --------------------------------- |
| Unweighted               | All 1               | Yes/No  | **BFS**                           |
| Directed Acyclic Graph   | Any (even negative) | No      | **Topological Sort + Relaxation** |
| Weighted Graph           | Positive            | Yes/No  | **Dijkstra**                      |
| Weighted Graph           | Negative edges      | Yes     | **Bellman-Ford**                  |
| All-pairs shortest paths | Any                 | Any     | **Floyd-Warshall**                |


| If the problem says... | Think...        | Use                                |
| ---------------------- | --------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| Prerequisites          | Dependencies    | **Indegree + Kahn's Algorithm**    |
| Course schedule        | Ordering        | **Indegree**                       |
| Build order            | Dependencies    | **Indegree**                       |
| Can finish all tasks?  | Cycle detection | **Indegree**                       |
| Root of DAG            | Starting point  | **Indegree = 0**                   |
| Multiple parents       | Invalid tree    | **Indegree > 1**                   |
| Everyone knows X       | Celebrity       | **Indegree = n−1, Outdegree = 0**  |
| Visit every edge once  | Euler Path      | **Compare indegree and outdegree** |
| Terminal state         | End node        | **Outdegree = 0**                  |

// 1. Build graph
ArrayList<Integer>[] graph = new ArrayList[n];

// 2. Compute indegree
int[] indegree = new int[n];
for (int[] edge : edges) {
    int u = edge[0];
    int v = edge[1];
    graph[u].add(v);
    indegree[v]++;
}

// 3. Add all indegree-0 nodes
Queue<Integer> q = new LinkedList<>();
for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
    if (indegree[i] == 0)
        q.offer(i);
}

// 4. Process
while (!q.isEmpty()) {
    int node = q.poll();

    for (int next : graph[node]) {
        indegree[next]--;

        if (indegree[next] == 0)
            q.offer(next);
    }
}
